# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出/提交时自动转换
# 配合 .editorconfig 使用，避免 Windows 与 WSL 之间的 CRLF/LF 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.jar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.mp4 binary
